{'symbol': 'EXR', 'date': '2023-05-02 16:10:00', 'title': 'EXTRA SPACE STORAGE INC. REPORTS 2023 FIRST QUARTER RESULTS', 'text': 'SALT LAKE CITY , MAY 2, 2023 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- EXTRA SPACE STORAGE INC. (NYSE: EXR) (THE "COMPANY"), A LEADING OWNER AND OPERATOR OF SELF-STORAGE FACILITIES IN THE UNITED STATES AND A CONSTITUENT OF THE S&P 500, ANNOUNCED OPERATING RESULTS FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED MARCH 31, 2023. HIGHLIGHTS FOR THE THREE MONTHS ENDED MARCH 31, 2023: ACHIEVED NET INCOME ATTRIBUTABLE TO COMMON STOCKHOLDERS OF $1.46 PER DILUTED SHARE, REPRESENTING A 3.3% DECREASE COMPARED TO THE SAME PERIOD IN THE PRIOR YEAR.'}